      "interpretation": "南史字元魯，家世與青箱學相合。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p004",
      "start": 185,
      "end": 188,
      "surface": "子興之",
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi024-ws1765279.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1765279,
      "line": 161,
      "first_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 12,
      "quote": "子輿之，-{征}-虜主簿",
      "sha256": "8fd9281c1d58e066b75c0b6cce86fff07d6e11c8ad6426459f8e0f2139a29499",
      "interpretation": "南史輿之，官、父同；另有贛令王氏墓誌興之。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p001",
      "start": 35,
      "end": 38,
